Begin Exploring Related Columns
column name: potential usage  
• NATURE."body": Source text that needs to be tokenized into individual words.  
• NATURE."id": Primary identifier to be returned with each article vector.  
• NATURE."date": Publication (or scraped) date that must be returned with each article vector.  
• NATURE."title": Article title that must be returned with each article vector.  
• WORD_FREQUENCIES."word": Term to join against the tokens extracted from "body".  
• WORD_FREQUENCIES."frequency": Term‑frequency used to apply the 0.4‑power weight to each word vector.  
• GLOVE_VECTORS."word": Term to join against the tokens extracted from "body".  
• GLOVE_VECTORS."vector": 300‑dimensional GloVe vector that will be re‑weighted and summed for every article.  

Typical conditions that might be used  
• NATURE."body" IS NOT NULL — exclude empty articles.  
• WORD_FREQUENCIES."word" IS NOT NULL AND GLOVE_VECTORS."word" IS NOT NULL — keep vocabulary terms that have both a frequency and a GloVe vector.  
• Possibly filter out extremely high/low frequencies, or remove stop‑words (not shown below).  

